          "text": "Alimwi ambila bantu bacisi kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova aabantu bakede mu-Jerusalemu amucisi ca-Juda. Bayoolya insima yabo cabucenjezu akunywa maanzi aabo cakuyoowa, kuti nyika yabo isaalwe azintu zyoonse zili mulinjiyo, nkaambo kaluuni lwabaabo bakede mumo. ",
